# My First HTML Website 🌐

A simple beginner-friendly HTML project that demonstrates how to create multiple web pages and link one page to another.

## 📌 About the Project

This project contains two HTML pages:

- `my.check.html` — First page
- `second.html` — Second page

The first page contains a button/link. When the user clicks **Click**, it opens the second HTML page.

## 📁 Project Structure

```text
MyWebsite/
│
├── my.check.html
├── second.html
└── README.md
